r the statue of Mary."},{"kind":"audio","t":32177.831113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32183.064878999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32188.403154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32193.817866999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":32199.27914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32204.614385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32209.139292,"samples":30192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":38988.379677,"text":"日本の原子力省によりは原発内で放射性セシウムという要素が特定されています"},{"kind":"text","t":39326.618158,"text":"The Japanese Ministry of Nuclear Energy has identified the element radioactive cesium within the nuclear power plant."},{"kind":"audio","t":39388.19449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39393.282459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39398.567014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39403.672142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39408.725641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":39413.985487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":39416.778787,"samples":24192,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":54413.156807,"text":"漏れ聞いた情報によれば、当該文書は国境紛争に言及するもので、パレスチナの希望は1967年の中東戦争前の国境に基づくものです。"},{"kind":"text","t":55034.902451,"text":"According to leaked information, the document in question refers to border disputes, and Palestine's hope is based on the borders prior to the 1967 Middle East War."},{"kind":"audio","t":55102.505718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55107.717095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55113.102949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55118.287